  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Handle to a File Storage or Key-Value Storage. A SharedHandle is returned by the functions OpenFileStorage() and OpenKeyValueStorage() and can be passed between threads as needed. It provides the abstraction that is necessary to allow thread-safe implementation of OpenFile Storage() and OpenKeyValueStorage().</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
